Subject: [RFC PATCH 26/28] arm64: rme: Allow checking SVE on VM instance
Date: Fri, 27 Jan 2023 11:29:30 +0000
Message-Id: <20230127112932.38045-27-steven.price@arm.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
